/*
 * The tile.
 *
 * Two rules run through all of it. First, everything sits on the eight-pixel
 * grid and takes its colour, its type and its spacing from `tokens.css`; there
 * are two raw numbers below and both are commented where they appear. Second,
 * there are no shadows anywhere — separation comes from a one-pixel line at a
 * tenth of the text colour, which is drawn as part of the tile's outline rather
 * than as a border, so that a hypothesis and a dead end can be different shapes.
